            "review_title": "Review at Shangri Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Hiền Phạm\nTien Giang Province, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nAn exciting morning.\nMar 2024 • Friends\nA charming space nestled by the river, beautifully designed café.\nEnjoying a morning cup of coffee with French pastries, and exploring a variety of delicious Vietnamese dishes for lunch and dinner is a part of Vietnamese culture. Especially, with the addition of BBQ, Draft Beer, Cocktails, and more.\nWritten March 24, 2024",
